SUMMARY:Atlanta Black Restaurant Week 2026
DESCRIPTION:« All Events\n 				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n	Sunday Brunch				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n		\n			August 16\n\n	\n\n	  @  \n\n\n2:00 PM\n\n		\n\n\n\n	\n	  -  \n\n4:00 PM\n\n\n\n	\n				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n	\n				\n				\n				\n				\n									Make Sunday your favorite day of the week with brunch\, live music\, handcrafted cocktails\, and patio vibes at 1942 On The Square! Join us for an afternoon of great food and live entertainment featuring Zeke Potter\, live at 2 PM. As a featured participant in Black Restaurant Week\, it’s the perfect time to gather with friends\, support local\, and experience the best of the Southside. Your Sunday Includes Live Music by Zeke Potter — 2 PMBrunch FavoritesSignature Cocktails & MimosasAugust Tequila Feature: $5 Teremana Blanco or Reposado Shots\, $10 Teremana Margaritas  Patio Dining • Great Food • Great Music • Great Vibes 								\n				\n				\n				\n									\n					\n						\n									Learn More\n					\n					\n				\n								\n				\n				\n						\n					\n			\n						\n				\n					\n	\n\n	Categories:	\n		Atlanta	\n\n				\n				\n					\n		\n				\n			\n						\n				\n					\n	\n			\n			Black Restaurant Week\, LLC			\n	\n\n	\n	\n\n	Phone:\n					\n						\n	 \n\n\n	\n\n	Website: \n\n\n	\n	Email:\n					\n			info@blackrestaurantweeks.com			\n	 \n\n\n\n				\n				\n					\n		\n					\n		\n				\n						\n					\n			\n						\n				\n					\n				\n				\n	\n			\n		1942 on the Square			\n	\n	\n	\n\n3B Keys Ferry St\n	\n		\n		McDonough\,\n\n	GA\n\n	30253\n\n	United States\n\n\n\n\n	+ Google Map \n\n\n	\n					\n						\n	 \n\n\n	\n	 \n\n\n\n	\n\n		\n	\n				\n				\n					\n		\n					\n		\n				\n						\n					\n			\n						\n				\n					\n	\n		\n\n	\n	Add to calendar	\n		\n	\n\n		\n			\n									\n	Google Calendar\n\n									\n	iCalendar\n\n									\n	Outlook 365\n\n									\n	Outlook Live\n\n							\n		\n\n		\n	\n\n				\n				\n					\n		\n					\n		\n				\n						\n					\n			\n						\n				\n					\n	\n		\n\n				HBCU Send Off	\n\n\n		\n	\n		Los Angele